## Interface: 120000, 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: PUG Lyfe
## Notes: Your private PUG journal. Rate the players you group with and leave yourself a note; next time they join your group, a small reminder tells you what you thought. Personal only: nothing is shared. Type /pug to open it.
